• Operate the DHC-8-200 in accordance with EASA regulations, company Operations Manuals, Standard Operating Procedures (SOPs), and customer requirements.&nbsp;

• Conduct passenger, cargo, and special mission transport flights as Second-in-Command, ensuring safe and efficient mission delivery.&nbsp;

• Perform flight planning, performance calculations, fuel planning, weight and balance assessments, and route analysis to support operational requirements.&nbsp;

• Monitor weather, airspace constraints, aircraft systems, and operational risks to maintain the highest standards of flight safety and regulatory compliance.&nbsp;

• Coordinate with Air Traffic Control (ATC), ground handling agents, maintenance personnel, operational control, and customer representatives to ensure seamless mission execution.&nbsp;

